<%# The list of records carrying one tag, on that tag's details page. `path`
    resolves each record to its own details page, so a tag is a way into the
    records it labels. Every tag the record carries is shown beside it, not
    just the one filtering this list.

    A remembered create appears here too, when its payload carries this tag or —
    with `include_descendants` — one of this tag's descendants. **This is a list
    workspace like any other**: the tag page is where a reader goes to ask which
    records carry a tag, and an author who has just tagged a new character would
    otherwise not find it there. Its row is read rather than linked, because a
    remembered create has no id to build a path from, and it prints the tag badges
    the payload carries rather than a lookup that does not exist yet.

    `pending` is passed rather than resolved here so that the caller decides the
    scope: `shared/_tagged_records_by_child_tag` asks per child tag, and a tag page
    with the descendants toggle on or off asks a different question each way. %>
<% tags_by_record = local_assigns[:tags_by_record] || record_tags_for(local_assigns.fetch(:records)) %>
<% pending = local_assigns[:pending] || [] %>
<div class="list-group list-group-flush">
  <% local_assigns.fetch(:records).each do |record| %>
    <div class="list-group-item entity-row d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
      <div class="entity-copy flex-grow-1">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
          <span class="entity-title">
            <%= link_to record_label(record),
              local_assigns.fetch(:path).call(record), class: "text-break" %>
          </span>
          <% tags_by_record.fetch(record.id, []).each do |tag| %>
            <%= tag_badge(tag) %>
          <% end %>
          <%= render "shared/draft_pending_badge", state: draft_pending_state(record) %>
        </div>
        <% if record.description.present? %>
          <div class="entity-description"><%= record.description %></div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% end %>

  <%= render partial: "shared/draft_pending_rows", collection: pending, as: :record %>
</div>